 "Downtime": "help:parents-guide",
 "Each village has its own host friend, who sits in the header frame dressed for that village. You can change their outfit in the Wardrobe.": "help:meet-the-friends",
 "Events and seasons do run on a calendar, and some show a countdown to when they end. None of them puts a clock on a board.": "help:playing-calmly",
 "Every attempt comes with a free **Hint**, **Rocket** and **UFO**, and the first **Undo** on each board is free.": "help:playing-calmly",
 "Every number behind lives, undos, running out of moves and the eight optional videos, what Remove Ads and the Brick Pass change, what coins buy, and what OutBrick never sells.": "help:rewards-and-ads",
 "Every number on this page is the one the game uses today. If one ever changes, this page changes with it.": "help:rewards-and-ads",
 "Every one of the 2,000 levels can be played without paying or watching anything. Lives refill by themselves, every attempt comes with a free Hint, Rocket and UFO, and the first undo on every board is free. See [How rewards, lives and ads work](help:rewards-and-ads) for every number.": "help:parents-guide",
