 "No. Lives refill on their own, and every board can be played without watching or paying anything.": "help:rewards-and-ads",
 "No. Progress is kept on the device and in your own iCloud. The community on this website needs an account, but it is for people aged 16 and over and is not part of the game.": "help:parents-guide",
 "No. The game has no chat and no messaging between players. Other players can see a player name and level on the Leaders tab, and in a race your child chooses to join. Both can be switched off in **Settings › Game**.": "help:parents-guide",
 "No. The same buttons say **Claim reward** and pay at once, within the same daily limits.": "help:rewards-and-ads",
